ok 30 - the owner may grant itself every other grantable capability: reviewer, specialists and author included [P2-S09-AC-510]
ok 31 - a self-granted capability is effective
ok 32 - the byte-identical body (same subject, capability, validThrough day and reason) under a NEW key against an active aggregate is 409 [P2-S09-AC-527] [P2-S09-AC-530]
ok 33 - the 409 body repeats the first grant exactly: same validThrough day [P2-S09-AC-530]
ok 34 - the refused duplicate created no second aggregate [P2-S09-AC-530]
ok 35 - the backfilled owner-initialization aggregate is active: grant is 409, renewal is the path [P2-S09-AC-527]
ok 36 - the existing-active-aggregate 409 carries DETAIL ACTIVE_GRANT_EXISTS, the signal the Worker maps to recoveryAction renew [P2-S09-AC-527]
ok 37 - the backfilled owner-initialization aggregate raises the same signal [P2-S09-AC-527]
t
ok 38 - an exact same-key retry replays the first response [P2-S09-AC-530]
ok 39 - the replay appended no second event
ok 40 - the reason is stored normalized NFC
ok 41 - the same key with a changed body is refused IDEMPOTENCY_MISMATCH (wire 409 CONFLICT) [P2-S09-AC-530] [P2-S09-AC-537]
ok 42 - an idempotency mismatch never carries the renew signal: renew is directed only for an existing active aggregate [P2-S09-AC-527]
ok 43 - a failing outbox write fails the grant command [P2-S09-AC-531]
ok 44 - the failure rolled back the aggregate, event, projection, audit, outbox and idempotency record [P2-S09-AC-531]
